Fashion Product Images — data notice
====================================

Source
  Kaggle:    https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/paramaggarwal/fashion-product-images-dataset
  Publisher: Param Aggarwal
  Files used: styles.csv + images/ (1080x1440 product photos; a few 1800x2400)
  License:   MIT, as declared in the dataset's metadata on Kaggle.

What this repository uses
  Only the 1,000 products pinned in dataset/manifest.csv. Their photos ship
  with this repository in data/gallery/ as 480x640 JPEGs, downscaled from the
  high-resolution originals with Lanczos and saved at quality 90; 5 products
  whose largest upstream copy is below 480x640 are upscaled to the same size.
  data/metadata.csv
  holds the matching rows. The code reads only data/gallery/ and
  data/metadata.csv.

How the 1,000 were selected
  masterCategory == Footwear (9,222 rows)
  -> 500 Men + 500 Women
  -> within each gender, round-robin over baseColour
  Result: 40 colours and 8 articleTypes; common colours keep about 50 images
  each, rare colours stay in the gallery as distractors.

